    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Armor (@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbarmPlateArmor]{Plate Armor} or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbarmScaleMail0]{Scale Mail}), Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>While wearing this armor, you gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class. Whenever you regain Hit Points, the armor takes on a reddish tint, and this bonus increases to +2 until the end of your next turn.</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e.content24.JournalEntry.dmgFoundryRefere.JournalEntryPage.Ok4iCgD25ENgoRxE cite=false caption=false classes=\"hide-in-embed\"]</p>",
